usage: capacity_rebuild.py [-h] [--root ROOT] [--control CONTROL]
                           [--api-url API_URL] [--output-bytes OUTPUT_BYTES]
                           --report REPORT [--apply-plan APPLY_PLAN]
                           [--confirm CONFIRM]

Preview and explicitly apply a conservative isolated-executor capacity
rebuild. No files/artifacts or API task states are deleted or modified. Same
owner->capacity lock ordering as DockerExecutor; unknown evidence blocks
apply.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT
  --control CONTROL
  --api-url API_URL
  --output-bytes OUTPUT_BYTES
  --report REPORT       new report path outside managed roots
  --apply-plan APPLY_PLAN
                        previous preview report; absence means preview only
  --confirm CONFIRM     exact reviewed plan_id; mandatory for apply
